abstract: "Brainlyser performs serial atlas-indexed 2D analysis of mouse-brain blockface fluorescence photographs: YOLO11 brain detection, DINOv2-based atlas-level assignment with manual review, 2D similarity registration, and regional reporter-signal quantification with an interactive dashboard."
